# Test: RI-TLV registration hook (RFC 7770 sec 2.3/2.4, spec-ospf-ext-3).
#
# VALIDATES: a downstream consumer (standing in for Segment Routing / ext-5) registers a TLV
# via registerRITLV; the RI originator emits the type-1 Informational Capabilities TLV FIRST
# and then the registered TLV in the same RI LSA.
# PREVENTS: a registered TLV that never reaches the RI LSA, or one emitted before type-1.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run TestOSPFRIRegisterTLVFunctional -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
